How to Query Submatrix Sums Using Prefix Sum MatrixSuppose we want the sum of all elements inside a submatrix from (r1, c1) to (r2, c2), then the result is:prefix[r2][c2] - prefix[r1-1][c2] - prefix[r2][c1-1] + prefix[r1-1][c1-1]
